&lt;p&gt;Clever believes classrooms and our company should be diverse and inclusive. We celebrate actions that build diverse teams, include every voice, and create safe spaces for everyone to bring their authentic selves to work.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Clever does not conduct interviews via text or Telegram. We will never ask for your financial information or reimbursement of equipment of any kind. If you receive any communications regarding employment with Clever that you think might be a scam, please email &lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;mailto:recruitingscam@clever.co&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;mailto:recruitingscam@clever.co&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;recruitingscam@clever.com.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
