&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical Rigor:&lt;/strong&gt; The ability to move fluently between qualitative user feedback and quantitative performance data to make objective, impactful product decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer &amp;amp; Partner Focus:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated success in engaging with high-level stakeholders and technical partners to deliver premium experiences that solve deep-seated pain points.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Exceptional verbal and written skills, with a talent for articulating a vision that inspires internal teams and builds confidence with external partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications (Nice-to-Haves)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Strategy &amp;amp; Vision: &lt;/strong&gt;Experience developing or contributing to an AI product strategy—whether defining how AI improves user experience, navigating the risks of AI integration, or building AI-powered features in a consumer context.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience navigating international data regulations or scaling products for diverse regional markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EdTech Mission:&lt;/strong&gt; A genuine interest in the K-12 ecosystem and a commitment to creating more equitable learning outcomes through technology.&lt;/li&gt;
